1. This is a free, fun project.
2. Do not put inappropriate information.
3. Be nice.
4. Anyone can contribute.
5. Students are welcome as well.
6. This is a friendly project; you can also install and run the BuildGame and try it out.
7. You can add/update any new ideas or features to it.
8. You can leave a comment within the codes, or create a new chat box (I have not).
9. You can also leave reviews and comments on a new TXT file.
10. You are welcome to create your own branches.
